{"nodes":[{"id":"f3911929","parent_ids":[],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read AGENTS.md","timestamp":"22:36:41"},{"id":"65582ff1","parent_ids":["f3911929"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read Cargo.toml","timestamp":"22:36:42"},{"id":"4621e6ec","parent_ids":["65582ff1"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read src/main.rs","timestamp":"22:36:42"},{"id":"3cd3abb3","parent_ids":["4621e6ec"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read build.rs","timestamp":"22:36:42"},{"id":"448d0b08","parent_ids":["3cd3abb3"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read memory.x","timestamp":"22:36:43"},{"id":"2078df7c","parent_ids":["448d0b08"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read .cargo/config.toml","timestamp":"22:36:43"},{"id":"1db20687","parent_ids":["2078df7c"],"kind":"THINK","content":"Logical-microkernel-via-Embassy rejected; MPU-enforced privileged kernel chosen by user. Embassy executor incompatible — must drop embassy-executor + embassy-rp and go cortex-m-rt + rp2040-hal + rp2040-boot2. Cortex-M0+ MPU has 8 regions, power-of-two sizes, no MemManage exception (escalates to HardFault). PoC #1 scope: kernel boot → MPU setup → PSP setup → drop to unprivileged → user task → SVC syscall round-trip → demonstrate forbidden access faults.","timestamp":"22:40:35"},{"id":"62ff3a5c","parent_ids":["1db20687"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote Cargo.toml","timestamp":"22:42:19"},{"id":"d074b9e9","parent_ids":["62ff3a5c"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"Confirmed RP2040 has MPU (8 regions) via pico-sdk m0plus.h header. User flagged uncertainty; verified before proceeding.","timestamp":"22:47:34"},{"id":"e4e574ab","parent_ids":["d074b9e9"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote feedback_verify_chip_features.md","timestamp":"22:47:35"},{"id":"01489018","parent_ids":["e4e574ab"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote MEMORY.md","timestamp":"22:47:41"},{"id":"ec3d61c4","parent_ids":["01489018"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read mpu.rs","timestamp":"22:51:34"},{"id":"e2825aec","parent_ids":["ec3d61c4"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited Cargo.toml","timestamp":"22:51:46"},{"id":"e7cc4730","parent_ids":["e2825aec"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote memory.x","timestamp":"22:51:55"},{"id":"e39ca0c6","parent_ids":["e7cc4730"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote boot2.x","timestamp":"22:52:00"},{"id":"ff21ff43","parent_ids":["e39ca0c6"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote build.rs","timestamp":"22:52:06"},{"id":"8a03998a","parent_ids":["ff21ff43"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote src/main.rs","timestamp":"22:53:25"},{"id":"a0cac785","parent_ids":["8a03998a"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"22:54:16"},{"id":"6bf46bf7","parent_ids":["a0cac785"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited Cargo.toml","timestamp":"22:54:33"},{"id":"4fe4fb44","parent_ids":["6bf46bf7"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"22:54:38"},{"id":"db7fe898","parent_ids":["4fe4fb44"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"22:54:42"},{"id":"f1d00b42","parent_ids":["db7fe898"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"22:54:44"},{"id":"bfc09c66","parent_ids":["f1d00b42"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited Cargo.toml/build.rs/memory.x/boot2.x/src/main.rs: dropped embassy stack, switched to cortex-m-rt + rp2040-boot2 + cortex-m (with critical-section-single-core for defmt). Wrote Phase 1 microkernel: MPU setup (2 regions: task0 RAM RW unpriv, flash RX both), PSP drop to unprivileged thread mode via inline asm, SVCall handler dispatching SYSCALL_PRINT, SysTick heartbeat, HardFault handler. Single user task that prints via syscall and deliberately faults on iteration 5 to demo MPU enforcement.","timestamp":"22:59:17"},{"id":"c19a88bd","parent_ids":["bfc09c66"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote scripts/build-uf2.sh","timestamp":"23:11:36"},{"id":"62bd7f8c","parent_ids":["c19a88bd"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote .cargo/config.toml","timestamp":"23:11:54"},{"id":"81186dcc","parent_ids":["62bd7f8c"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read .gitignore","timestamp":"23:12:01"},{"id":"f7a1947f","parent_ids":["81186dcc"],"kind":"ACT","content"