e 1 PoC works on real XIAO RP2040 hardware. All three predicted LED behaviors observed: green heartbeat, blue syscall toggle, red HardFault on MPU violation at iter 5. The MPU enforcement is real, not theoretical.","timestamp":"23:19:16"},{"id":"f67d2e19","parent_ids":["1c76480c"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:28:18"},{"id":"24610400","parent_ids":["f67d2e19"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:28:21"},{"id":"12dfe77b","parent_ids":["24610400"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:28:24"},{"id":"d5f3d006","parent_ids":["12dfe77b"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:29:25"},{"id":"59f9e786","parent_ids":["d5f3d006"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:29:36"},{"id":"0e6d405c","parent_ids":["59f9e786"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:29:41"},{"id":"92b09db6","parent_ids":["0e6d405c"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:29:51"},{"id":"cee2e28e","parent_ids":["92b09db6"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:51:15"},{"id":"f5213e14","parent_ids":["cee2e28e"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:51:27"},{"id":"25124202","parent_ids":["f5213e14"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"23:51:50"},{"id":"53e999e4","parent_ids":["25124202"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"00:01:53"},{"id":"39f448df","parent_ids":["53e999e4"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"00:14:36"},{"id":"90354827","parent_ids":["39f448df"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"00:15:05"},{"id":"d063a98c","parent_ids":["90354827"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/main.rs","timestamp":"00:15:11"}]}